                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 6  -  Give mullions thickness
Goal: pipes around the vertical curves and the floor outlines.
Idea: One Pipe for the verticals, one for the floor lines,
   sharing the same radius slider.
Watch for: The radius is in feet: 0.25 ft = 3 in.
Wire check: radius slider -&gt; R.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
